      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-01-26_WidnesExaminer_art0034" n="art0034">
        <head>ASK FOR</head>
        <p>ASK FOR</p>
        <p>NO'S LIGHTNING coUGH CURE</p>
        <p>The puree and moat efficient Remedy vrocurablo for</p>
        <p>Coughs, Cotds, Broochlns, Astheron, .Cp..tarrh, Weak . _ _</p>
