        <p>Prevented by Baths wah Cuti- cura Soap and (lentle Applica- tions of Cuticura Ointment.</p>
        <p>Gently smear the face with Cuticura Ointment, the great Skin Cure, but do not rub. Wash off the Ointment in five minutes with Cutieura Soap and hot water and bathe freely for some minutes. Repeat morning and evening. At other times use Cutictua Soap for bathing the face as often as agreeable.</p>
        <p>Complete F.xternal and Internal Treatment for Every Humour of infants, Children, and Adults vonsists of Cuti- cure Soup (Is.) to Cleanse the Skin, Cutieura Ointment (is. 6d.) to Beal the Skin, and Cutieura Pills (Chocolate Coated, Is. lid. per vial of 60) to Purity the Blood. A Single Set often Cures. Sold th ro ug bout the e orld. Depots: London, Nevbery, 27 Charterhouse Sq.; Paris, Roberts, 6 Rue de is. Fgt. Potter Drug &amp; Chem. Corp., Sole Props. gar Mailed Free, "How to Cure Every Humour."</p>
        <p>A Hot Favourite in cola weather.</p>
        <p>A Corn Flour Baked Pudding with stewed prunes, figs, or apples - cioan, wholesome fare.</p>
        <p>Th; Corn Flour- of course- Rrown&amp; Poison' s</p>
        <p>" Patent "</p>
