        <head>FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>NORTHERN UNION LEAGUE, -</p>
        <p>RESULTS OF SATURDAY'S MATCHES.</p>
        <p>G. T. P. G. T. P. Warrington Broughton R. Halifax 4 1 11 Salford Oldham 9ll 51 Hull • 2 1 7 Widnes 1 2 8 Dewsbury 0 2 -6 Hull K. Rovers... 0 1 3 Wakefield T Runcorn Rochdale Hornets 2 3 13 Wigan Leigh *Huddersfield *Match stopped at half time. The matches between Leeds and Hunslet and Bramley and L'verpool City were postponed on account of fog.</p>
