        <p>Thotnas•M`Kee, the second officer of the steamer Greyfield, which was wrecked on November 21 in the Solway Firth, was rescued along with the others on board by the Alaryport lifeboat, bnt he disappeared on tho following day. He was last seen at night near the docks. On Wednesiay his body was taken from the Elizabeth-Dock. It is thought that he stumbled over the quay-side in the darkness.</p>
